    {
      "open": "/* ====================================================================\n * Data pieces every app drew itself [kpadopt4-data]: the identity mark,\n * the share bar, the bullet list, the key-value grid and the form rows,\n * the code block, and the page header's heading line.\n *\n *   .kp-idmark / .kp-idmark-group      a small identity chip made from a name\n *                                  (JobTracker `Mark`, homelab `stackMark`)\n *   .kp-stackbar                   one bar split into the parts of a whole,\n *                                  with its legend (homelab `hk-stack-bar`)\n *   .kp-bullets                    rows of a value against a threshold\n *                                  (JobTracker's follow-up clock)\n *   .kp-kv                         a read-only key-value grid (hl-kv, cf-kv,\n *                                  mp-kv, jt-kv, chassis' status `dl`)\n *   .kp-formrows / .kp-formrow     label | control | aside rows (jt-row,\n *                                  homelab `st-set`)\n *   .kp-code                       a payload or code block (kyu `snippet`)\n *   .kp-page-header__heading       a mark, the title, a badge and the\n *                                  freshness line on one line\n *\n * Behaviour: js/mark.js, js/stackbar.js, js/bullets.js, js/code.js and\n * js/tick.js. Drawn from the tokens alone until each register answers them\n * (gates/register-pending.json).\n * ==================================================================== */\n@layer kp.components {\n",
      "files": [
